497 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 371 0 R/T(Back then, I didn\220t fit the mould. I have ADHD, dyslexia, and the kind of brain that never quite sits still. I didn\220t read books for fun \204 only when I absolutely had to pass an exam. It wasn\220t the official professors who changed my life \204 it was the unofficial ones: Steven Bartlett, Bren\351 Brown, Stephen Covey, Napoleon Hill, Mel Robbins, Tony Robbins, Dean Graziosi, James Clear. These were the authors who handed me the mindset shifts, habits, and courage I needed to actually start building my life, not just pass tests.)/E(Back then, I didn\220t fit the mould. I have ADHD, dyslexia, and the kind of brain that never quite sits still. I didn\220t read books for fun \204 only when I absolutely had to pass an exam. It wasn\220t the official professors who changed my life \204 it was the unofficial ones: Steven Bartlett, Bren\351 Brown, Stephen Covey, Napoleon Hill, Mel Robbins, Tony Robbins, Dean Graziosi, James Clear. These were the authors who handed me the mindset shifts, habits, and courage I needed to actually start building my life, not just pass tests.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

498 0 obj
