2440 0 obj
<</Title(If you\220re expecting a book full of business buzzwords and textbook definitions \204 this isn\220t it. And if I\220m honest, that\220s exactly the kind of book I would\220ve ignored as a teenager. Even though I have a master\220s degree in economics, I didn\220t write this journal to teach you about balance sheets or inflation. I learned the most important things about life, entrepreneurship, and myself after university \204 not during it.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2434 0 R/Next 2444 0 R>>
endobj

2441 0 obj
<</Title(Back then, I didn\220t fit the mould. I have ADHD, dyslexia, and the kind of brain that never quite sits still. I didn\220t read books for fun \204 only when I absolutely had to pass an exam. It wasn\220t the official professors who changed my life \204 it was the unofficial ones: Steven Bartlett, Bren\351 Brown, Stephen Covey, Napoleon Hill, Mel Robbins, Tony Robbins, Dean Graziosi, James Clear. These were the authors who handed me the mindset shifts, habits, and courage I needed to actually start building my life, not just pass tests.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2434 0 R/Prev 2444 0 R>>
endobj

